elines\".\n　　　　Approval and Cancellation of Requests\" in the \"Creator Guidelines,\n　　　　If you receive a request, you must \"Approve\" it before starting to draw it.\n　　　　　　　　　You will not be paid until you approve the request. Did you see the \"Approval and Cancellation\" section of the \"Creator Guideline\"?\n　　　　Did you not read it? Did you not read it, or is that a violation of the Skeb Terms and Conditions? You are in violation of the Skeb Terms and Conditions.\n　　　　You will be kicked out of the program.\n\nPlease be careful.\n\nThat is all.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/OFUTONmogumogu/status/1674666592414879745", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OFUTONmogumogu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/326eaed6/uploads/origins/e58f5bd3-4315-4e8c-93b4-35cb39d4827e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6d076d94269a7d27cf7ea89e45e384b9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/326eaed6/uploads/origins/e58f5bd3-4315-4e8c-93b4-35cb39d4827e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6d076d94269a7d27cf7ea89e45e384b9, https://si.imgix.net/326eaed6/uploads/origins/e58f5bd3-4315-4e8c-93b4-35cb39d4827e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1b2e54c7c78e871a7c3c245414f54965 2x, https://si.imgix.net/326eaed6/uploads/origins/e58f5bd3-4315-4e8c-93b4-35cb39d4827e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3d0f9ffc78f38b34369d3b280406c870 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": tru